OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies role in crash that
OL,4,Akilled four including brother
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court to deny
OL,7,Faiding and abetting dangerous driving
OL,8,Fafter a car crash in which his brother
OL,9,Fand three other men were killed.
OL,11,FJack Diggle, 23, Benjamin Dooley, 23,
OL,12,FAndrew Roberts, 24, and Craig
OL,13,FShackleton-Brady, 26, died at the scene
OL,14,Fof the crash on East Prescot Road in
OL,15,FHuyton, Merseyside, on 24 July.
OL,17,FJack Diggle's brother James Diggle, 27,
OL,18,Fpleaded not guilty to three counts of
OL,19,Faiding and abetting Dooley to cause the
OL,20,Fdeaths of the three other men at
OL,21,FLiverpool Crown Court earlier.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
